  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "269a2d62-ad1f-4f62-9fba-ee8adc3e3145",
    "name": "Salesgraph REST Audit API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The same GTM research and audit engine behind the Salesgraph MCP server, exposed as a small REST API under `/api/v1`. Command endpoints use API key authentication and return markdown (`Content-Type: text/markdown`) on success; OMS endpoints return JSON; errors are returned as JSON. Synchronous commands (research, competitors, help) return the markdown result inline; asynchronous audits (gtm-audit, audit) return a run id to poll. The OMS (Opportunity Management System) endpoints query the organization's own visible sales objects, traverse their relationships, and manage continuous research watches. A separate unauthenticated Status API at `/api/status` publishes component health.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Salesgraph Support\n Email: support@salesgraph.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
